      "description": "One STAC item per hosted quarter-quad COG: 245,554 rows. Each row gives the file's address, size and checksum, its footprint in degrees, its CRS, bounds and transform, and the flight date from its name. Pennsylvania 2024 and West Virginia 2024, which cover part of each state, are not listed. Rows follow a Hilbert curve. Each row's naip:gti_location gives the file's address relative to stac/, for GDAL's GTI driver (stac/naip.gti).",
